msgstr "ขั้นตอนถัดไป {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Check out two Qiskit addons, [Shaded lightcones](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/) and [Propagated noise absorption](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-pna), which are built on top of this execution model.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"คำแนะนำ\">\n"
"- ลองดู Qiskit addon สองตัว ได้แก่ [Shaded lightcones](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/) และ [Propagated noise absorption](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-pna) ซึ่งสร้างบน execution model นี้\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
